{
    "comment": "쿠폰 목록 — 발급상태 일괄변경 확인 창. 고른 쿠폰들을 발급중/발급중지로 한꺼번에 돌린다.\n  바꿀 방향(`bulkIssueStatus`)에 따라 안내 문장이 갈리므로 문단이 둘이고, 고른 건수와 방향은\n  목록이 `_global` 에 담아 둔 것을 읽는다.\n  \n  발급중지로 돌려도 **이미 나간 쿠폰은 회수되지 않는다** — 새 발급만 막힌다(회수는 발급취소다).",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Coupon - Status Change Confirm Modal"
    },
    "id": "modal_status_change_confirm",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.promotion_coupon.modal.status_change.title",
        "size": "sm",
        "footer": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "closeModal"
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_global.isChangingStatus}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "comment": "상태 일괄변경. 성공하면 고른 목록과 방향을 함께 비운다 — 남겨 두면 목록의 선택 표시와 서버 상태가 갈린다",
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "sequence",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "handler": "setState",
                                "params": {
                                    "target": "global",
                                    "isChangingStatus": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/promotion-coupons/bulk-status",
                                "auth_required": true,
                                "params": {
                                    "method": "PATCH",
                                    "body": {
                                        "ids": "{{_global.bulkSelectedItems}}",
                                        "issue_status": "{{_global.bulkIssueStatus}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                "onSuccess": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "isChangingStatus": false,
                                            "bulkSelectedItems": [],
                                            "bulkIssueStatus": ""
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                        "params": {
                                            "dataSourceId": "coupons"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "success",
                                            "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.promotion_coupon.toast.status_changed"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "closeModal"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "onError": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "isChangingStatus": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "error",
                                            "message": "{{error.message ?? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.common.error.general'}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-blue-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-blue-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_global.isChangingStatus}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Icon",
                        "if": "{{_global.isChangingStatus}}",
                        "props": {
                            "name": "spinner",
                            "className": "ecommerce-spinner-sm"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "{{_global.isChangingStatus ? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.common.processing' : '$t:common.confirm'}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "if": "{{_global.bulkIssueStatus === 'issuing'}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce-text-secondary"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.promotion_coupon.modal.status_change.message|count={{(_global.bulkSelectedItems ?? []).length}}|status=$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.enums.coupon_issue_status.issuing"
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "if": "{{_global.bulkIssueStatus !== 'issuing'}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce-text-secondary"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.promotion_coupon.modal.status_change.message|count={{(_global.bulkSelectedItems ?? []).length}}|status=$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.enums.coupon_issue_status.stopped"
        }
    ]
}
